00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:05,050
Subtraction with regrouping within 20.

2
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:10,110
Your rabbit's garden has 14 carrots.

3
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:14,570
Your rabbit pulls 5 carrots to bring home.

4
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:21,340
How many carrots are left in your rabbit's garden?

5
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,800
There are 14 carrots

6
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:31,000
Pull out 5 carrots

7
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:35,220
How many carrots are left?

8
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:41,600
What is the calculation?

9
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,020
Subtraction calculation

10
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:53,250
The calculation is 14 minus 5 equals how many?

11
00:00:55,400 --> 00:01:03,220
The teacher will guide you to perform calculation 14 minus 5 equals how many.

12
00:01:04,850 --> 00:01:07,820
We do as follows: Method 1:

13
00:01:09,620 --> 00:01:24,220
We count out 14 carrots, take away 5 carrots, 9 carrots are left.

14
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:31,940
So: 14 minus 5 equals 9

15
00:01:34,220 --> 00:01:35,310
Method 2:

16
00:01:36,420 --> 00:01:44,770
14 minus 4 equals 10, so we split 5 into 4 and 1

17
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:51,200
We have 14 minus 4 minus 1 equals how many?

18
00:01:54,310 --> 00:01:59,050
10 minus 1 equals 9

19
00:02:04,050 --> 00:02:10,600
So 14 minus 5 equals 9

